[statement]
The world's names and the request's are decided together, in name order:
`x`, requested, is decided first, for `p1`, and the world's `y` then for
`p2`. Contrast `a-choice-for-the-request-steers-a-world-name`.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1
p:x y=1
k:10

P:p3
V:1
p:y=1

[world]
y

[request]
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1
install p2 1
